#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-10-01-000007.md:10
msgid "エクスポート先を選択してください。"
msgstr "Choose an export destination."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-10-01-000007.md:12
msgid "原因"
msgstr "Why this happens"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-10-01-000007.md:14
msgid "セッション、シーン、またはプレイブラストの保存先が未指定です。セッションのエクスポートではActorとCharacterも必要です。"
msgstr ""
"A destination required by session export, scene export, or playblast "
"export was not supplied. Session export also requires Actor and "
"Character."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-10-01-000007.md:16
msgid "対処方法"
msgstr "How to resolve it"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-10-01-000007.md:18
msgid ""
"セッションのエクスポートでは保存先フォルダーを選び、ActorとCharacterを入力してください。Scene "
"exportまたはPlayblastでは、その出力の設定で保存先を選択してから、同じ出力を再実行してください。"
msgstr ""
"For session export, select the destination folder and enter Actor and "
"Character. For Scene export or Playblast, select that output’s "
"destination in its export settings, then retry the same output."

